#note "TRTPG1, TRTA and TRTAG1 all present -> noViolation"
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col TRTPG1 type=Char
col TRTA type=Char
col TRTAG1 type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | GROUP1 | DRUG A | GROUP1
